# Everything in this repo runs in a Linux container, so check EVERYTHING out
# with LF — not just shell scripts. Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites
# LF->CRLF on checkout, and `railway up` uploads the working tree as-is:
#   - entrypoint.sh: exec .../entrypoint.sh: No such file or directory ("/bin/bash\r")
#   - src/gbrain-shim.mjs (2026-09-21): /usr/bin/env: 'node\r': No such file or directory
# The second one broke every `gbrain` command in the container on its first deploy.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
